WEBVTT

00:08:57.053 --> 00:09:00.604
that local people in areas of very hot conflict

00:09:00.604 --> 00:09:03.040
know what to do.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:05.256
They know best what to do.

00:09:05.256 --> 00:09:08.538
So Peace Direct gets behind them to do that.

00:09:08.538 --> 00:09:10.737
And the kind of thing they're doing

00:09:10.737 --> 00:09:13.905
is demobilizing militias,

00:09:13.905 --> 00:09:16.508
rebuilding economies,

00:09:16.508 --> 00:09:18.858
resettling refugees,

00:09:18.858 --> 00:09:24.359
even liberating child soldiers.

00:09:24.359 --> 00:09:27.225
And they have to risk their lives almost every day

00:09:27.225 --> 00:09:30.444
to do this.